  <h1>Ali Almo<span class="s7">7</span>aya</h1>
  <p class="meta">staff web engineer @ Anghami &amp; OSN+ · Yemen → Riyadh · <a href="https://github.com/Almo7aya">github.com/Almo7aya</a></p>
  <p>I'm a staff web engineer at Anghami and OSN+. I build apps for the web and for TVs, and I mostly focus on the video player: playback and DRM.</p>
  <p>After hours I go lower: emulators, C++ and GPUs. I contribute to <a href="https://github.com/KytyPS5/KytyPS5">KytyPS5</a>, wrote <a href="https://almo7aya.dev/leaning-something/">Learning KytyPS5</a>, and the home page of this site boots <a href="/os/almo7aya.asm">7OS</a>, a tiny real-mode OS I wrote, on an 8086 emulator I also wrote.</p>
